{"overview":"اوتا ساکورا، دانش‌آموزی در دوره متوسطه، هر فرصتی را برای آواز خواندن استفاده می‌کند. اما موسیقی وقتی تبدیل به بیش از یک سرگرمی می‌شود که او با پوریرون، یک پری که شهرزادش به تاریکی فرو رفته، آشنا می‌شود. باند چوککیری سرزمین او را تصرف کرده و درخشندگی مردمش را می‌دزدند. اوتا برای کمک مصمم می‌شود، به قهرمان افسانه‌ای «کیور آیدول» تبدیل می‌شود و عهد می‌بندد با آواز، درخشندگی آن‌ها را بازگرداند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Middle school student Uta Sakura loves to sing any chance she gets. But music becomes more than a hobby when she meets Purirun, a fairy whose hometown has plunged into darkness. The Chokkiri Gang took over her land and began stealing her people's sparkle. Determined to help, Uta is transformed into the legendary protector Cure Idol and vows to return their sparkle through song.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":49,"y":2025,"poster":"/fvmTTlKu2Q6q4pQMu62SZpQEiVT.jpg"}],"episodes":49,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"松岡美里","role":"Uta Sakura / Cure Idol (voice)","photo":"/zSB8zgGwFGFq2EL3cWobQifsIXt.jpg","en":"Misato Matsuoka"},{"name":"مینامی تاکاهاشی","role":"Nana Aokaze / Cure Wink (voice)","photo":"/9SRX6yrHGtGEJxcnLyGFhOZkXSH.jpg","en":"Minami Takahashi"},{"name":"高森奈津美","role":"Kokoro Shigure / Cure Kyun-Kyun (voice)","photo":"/lmoEgs5x8NchMlsXqmU4ZYsC8ey.jpg","en":"Natsumi Takamori"},{"name":"南條愛乃","role":"Purirun / Cure Zukyoon (voice)","photo":"/tkeAJsWuJMFdIYU0LrwHEPxBx77.jpg","en":"Yoshino Nanjo"},{"name":"花井美春","role":"Meroron / Cure Kiss (voice)","photo":"/uJLbkjW9MlyHVSaSIh3rqCmapBb.jpg","en":"Miharu Hanai"},{"name":"جونیچی سووابه","role":"Tanaka (voice)","photo":"/4S7c3n3r07A83HvkLrnWZGVhiHg.jpg","en":"Junichi Suwabe"},{"name":"矢作紗友里","role":"Chokkirinu (voice)","photo":"/sM2yxc7ph78w5lYpCek0TW6v5NV.jpg","en":"Sayuri Yahagi"},{"name":"山田浩貴","role":"Cutty (voice)","photo":"/hb5YFHAkYoVkMk8ESFoDuCTCaxA.jpg","en":"Hiroki Yamada"},{"name":"ستسوجی ساتو","r